---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Lo Spettacolo - PIANO B | Beppe Braida" description="PIANO B - Il nuovo spettacolo ONE MAN SHOW di Beppe Braida. Comicità pura per ogni tipo di evento.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero-content">
      <span class="badge">&#127917; One Man Show</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">"PIANO B"</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Il nuovo spettacolo di Beppe Braida</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="content-main">
        <h2>Lo Spettacolo</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>"PIANO B"</strong> è il nuovo spettacolo <em>ONE MAN SHOW</em> di Beppe Braida.
          Uno show divertentissimo e molto coinvolgente, ricco di sketch comici,
          imitazioni, gag esilaranti e momenti di interazione con il pubblico.
        </p>
        <p>
          Lo spettacolo è ideale per qualunque tipo di evento: piazze, aziende,
          eventi privati, sagre, feste e molto altro. Beppe Braida sa come
          intrattenere e far ridere qualunque tipo di pubblico!
        </p>

        <div class="feature-cards">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">&#127917;</div>
            <h3>One Man Show</h3>
            <p>Uno spettacolo completo con un artista a 360 gradi</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">&#128514;</div>
            <h3>Comicità Pura</h3>
            <p>Risate assicurate dall'inizio alla fine dello show</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">&#127925;</div>
            <h3>Musica Live</h3>
            <p>Momenti musicali che coinvolgono tutto il pubblico</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">&#127911;</div>
            <h3>Interazione</h3>
            <p>Il pubblico diventa parte integrante dello spettacolo</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Per chi è lo spettacolo?</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>&#10004; Feste di piazza e sagre</li>
          <li>&#10004; Eventi aziendali e team building</li>
          <li>&#10004; Cene di gala e cerimonie</li>
          <li>&#10004; Feste private e compleanni</li>
          <li>&#10004; Teatri e locali</li>
          <li>&#10004; Festival ed eventi estivi</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="cta-box">
          <h3>Vuoi "PIANO B" al tuo evento?</h3>
          <p>Contattaci per informazioni su disponibilità e preventivi!</p>
          <a href="/contatti" class="btn btn-primary">Richiedi informazioni &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="content-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/210590_62c4954cafb84d7989c5ee6e58bb616f~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_613,h_368,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/210590_62c4954cafb84d7989c5ee6e58bb616f~mv2.png"
            alt="Piano B - Beppe Braida"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <img
            src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/210590_4d1504164322456ca664230e2860ad5b~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_306,h_368,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/210590_4d1504164322456ca664230e2860ad5b~mv2.png"
            alt="Beppe Braida locandina"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .page-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.2) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 30%, rgba(29, 53, 87, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
      var(--color-darker);
  }

  .page-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease both;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease both;
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.15);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease both;
    animation-delay: 0.1s;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .content-main h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
  }

  .content-main h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .content-main p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .content-main strong { color: var(--color-text-strong); }

  .feature-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    background: var(--color-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.2);
  }

  .feature-card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .check-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .check-list li {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: var(--color-card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: background var(--transition);
  }

  .check-list li:hover {
    background: var(--color-card-hover);
  }

  .cta-box {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.1), rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.05));
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.15);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
  }

  .cta-box p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px var(--shadow-color);
  }

  .sidebar-card img {
    width: 100%;
    transition: transform var(--transition);
  }

  .sidebar-card:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .content-sidebar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .sidebar-card { margin-bottom: 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 8rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .feature-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cta-box { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .content-sidebar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar-card { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 7rem 1rem 2rem; }
    .content-main h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .cta-box h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  }
</style>
